# US-112267 — High-Level Analysis
**Title:** TAR Billing Files — Disbursements Tab — Foundation & ELD Simple Layout
**Module:** Tax Amount Reports → Disbursements Tab
**Date:** 2026-08-03

---

## What

Add a **Billing File** export button to the TAR Disbursements tab. When clicked by an eligible Elevate customer, it downloads a plain-text `.txt` file containing one fixed-width record per reported item in the selected TAR job. The file includes: Loan Number, Tax ID, Amount to Pay, and ELD Due Date.

The four in-scope customers are `1085`, `1090`, `1096`, and `2132` — identified by `LDBillingFilesInd = 'Y'` in their customer profile.

---

## Why

Elevate customers need a machine-readable billing file to update their own systems with all items reported under a TAR job. The file layout matches their existing client specification. This story delivers the complete end-to-end pipeline for the four identified customers as the first proof of delivery. All future billing file layouts build on this foundation.

---

## What Changes

| Layer | Change |
|---|---|
| **SQL — LASCommon** | New SP `usp_sel_LDBillingFilesInd` — reads `LDBillingFilesInd` from `lac_CustomerProfile` for a given `CustId` |
| **SQL — db_TaxAmtReports** | New SP `usp_cta_GetTARBillingFile_sel` — returns all billing file rows (LoanId, TaxId, AmountToPay, NextELDDate) for a given TAR run |
| **Classic TAX API remoting** | New BLL method `GetTARBillingFile` and DAL method wired into the existing `TAXAMOUNTREPORTS` dispatcher |
| **Web Service** | New method `GetTARBillingFileAsync` in `TaxAmtDisbursementService` calling the Classic TAX API |
| **Web Interface** | New method added to `ITaxAmtDisbursementService` |
| **MVC Controller** | New action `ExportBillingFile` in `TaxAmountReportsController`; customer gate check populates `ShowBillingFileButton` flag on page load |
| **ViewModel** | `ShowBillingFileButton` flag added to `TaxAmountReportsViewModel` |
| **View** | Billing File button conditionally rendered in `TaxAmtDisbursement.cshtml` when `ShowBillingFileButton = true` |
| **JS** | Click handler for Billing File button wired into `TaxAmtDisbursement.js` |
| **AppConstants** | New route constant added to `RoutePrefixConstants` if required |

---

## What Stays the Same

- All existing export buttons (Export Pay Items, Export Do Not Pay Items, Export Disbursement Amount) are unchanged.
- The Disbursements tab page load, grid, save, and all other existing actions are unchanged.
- Customers without `LDBillingFilesInd = 'Y'` see no change — button is hidden.
- No changes to `lac_CustomerProfile` table schema — the column already exists.

---

## Expected Outcome

- Eligible customers (`LDBillingFilesInd = 'Y'`) see a **Billing File** button on the Disbursements tab.
- Ineligible customers see no button.
- Clicking the button downloads `BillingFile-{RunName}-{CustomerId}.txt` — a plain-text UTF-8 file, one 80-character fixed-width record per reported item in the TAR job.
- Each record contains: Loan Number (pos 1–10), Tax ID (pos 11–35), Amount to Pay (pos 47–56, right-justified integer cents), ELD Due Date (pos 57–62, `MMDDYY`).

